    <briefdescription>
<para>An error class from which all PDI error are children. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Offers access to<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>an error message (<computeroutput>what</computeroutput>) from std::exception</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>an error code (<computeroutput><ref refid="classPDI_1_1Error_1a7fb64e936c028cafc3a609c0ac024e4a" kindref="member">status</ref></computeroutput>)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>a longer error message for verbose output (<computeroutput><ref refid="classPDI_1_1Error_1a69a856067a473c3fdaa72bd697732174" kindref="member">full_msg</ref></computeroutput>)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the ability to be rethrown with added context (<computeroutput><ref refid="classPDI_1_1Error_1adf8e31a7ccef636756e92819bd936bcb" kindref="member">rethrow_with_context</ref></computeroutput>) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
